{"synopsis":"Berserker Bartz seorang pemain solo legendaris di Arpedia Online suatu hari mendapati karakternya diretas dan dihapus\nSial Mana mungkin aku menyerah Aku tidak tahu siapa kau tapi aku akan mencari dan menghancurkanmu\nSetelah kehilangan karakter yang ia perjuangkan dengan seluruh kemampuannya Kang YuHan membuat Zigg seorang blacksmith yang hanya memiliki satu misi menemukan peretasnya\nBisakah YuHan menemukan peretas yang menghapus Bartz\nIkuti petualangan aksi Zigg untuk menjadi blacksmith terhebat","alternative_title":"Blacksmith Zig, Blacksmith Jig, 대장장이 지그","author":"Kang Chan","artist":"Next Level Studio","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"46907880-d6ac-4aad-b3b5-fdd762667b5b","number":"67","chapter":"67","title":"","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02"},{"chapter_id":"b0fbe212-2605-414e-92f3-2bcbfc5084d1","number":"66","chapter":"66","title":"","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02"},{"chapter_id":"a6e70cc5-0ff4-4c9e-9ab7-5d463b67da69","number":"65","chapter":"65","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","released":"2024-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"b4287ba8-3df0-4a79-9567-2c60ab0fb953","number":"64","chapter":"64","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","released":"2024-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"a28bfb4f-c695-4a50-89e3-0b8ddcfdb263","number":"63","chapter":"63","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","released":"2024-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"c812cc95-db42-4ad0-9bcd-f00983cde258","number":"62","chapter":"62","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","released":"2024-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"5bba5092-d1b7-40c7-8c24-3e016e868156","number":"61","chapter":"61","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","released":"2024-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"93993fb2-7b1c-4c60-9ea9-5fe8662e7cbf","number":"60","chapter":"60","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","released":"2024-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"45713ac3-71b3-442e-9e46-d99c9979851c","number":"59","chapter":"59","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","released":"2024-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"77bfd0e0-301d-438d-bf72-e5c4734b2383","number":"58","chapter":"58","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","r